oil, grow plants, create habitats for returning wildlife, upcycle things humanity left behind, befriend ancient spirits and, most importantly, hug ALL the animals!!We’ve been working on creating a game and a world that makes a difference for 2,5 years, and this c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:00:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029610","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:03:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1846651706691251","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update for the Steam Next Fest! 🌱🍂","summary":"Hello, dear friends! 🌱Steam Next Fest is here, and The Regreening is taking part! 🎉From October 19th to October 26th, you can find us in the biggest Steam Demo Festival alongside other wonderful new games. If you haven't had a chance to start your regreening journey yet, this is the perfect time to jump into our free demo!! Prepare the soil, plant seeds, create habitats for returning wildlife, upcycle what humanity left behind and, of course, give the animals a ton of hugs along the way 💚And for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:55:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691251","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1845383656380977","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"The Regreening Demo is OUT NOW! 🌱🦊","summary":"Dear Friends!! 🌱 The wait is over, TELL EVERYONE! Your friends, your pets, and even your mom! The Regreening Demo is now available to play on Steam! After four playtests, thousands of players, lots of feedback, and more than a few bugs squashed along the way, we’re ready to open up the next chapter of Viri’s journey to everyone. Thank you for helping us get here! We’ve now reached over 50,000 wishlists, which is an incredible milestone for our little regreening journey. 💚 So, what’s waiting for ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T12:00:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380977","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1844115010501151","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"Small delay on The Regreening Demo 😔💚","summary":"Dear Friends! 🌱We have some important news.Unfortunately, we ran into some hiccups with our Steam Demo and will not be able to launch today as previously announced 😔But fear not! The bunnies, the butterflies, and everyone on our side have gathered to get the Steam Demo up and running as soon as possible!What does this mean for our future world restoration experts (that's you!!) ☝️👀We hope to set the demo live later this week, so keep an eye here and on our socials for updates.It might take a tin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T11:54:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1841579228663469","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for Playtesting! Our Demo Arrives on September 21st!","summary":"Dear Friends! 🌱 Our playtests have officially come to an end, and before we move on to the next chapter of The Regreening, we want to say a huge thank you to everyone who joined us! THANK YOU FOR PLAYTESTING!Over the course of four playtests, 7,300 of you explored Viri's world, restored ecosystems, decorated your homes, hugged animals, reported bugs, shared feedback, and helped us improve the game along the way. You've spent, on average, about 1h and 15 min in the playtest, while over 600 player","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T18:17:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228663469","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1838407329266071","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"Updated Playtest is Here! 🌦️♻️🏡","summary":"Hello, dear Friends! 🌱Welcome to our Playtest #4! We're opening it up again as part of the Games composed in Germany Steam event!This update introduces dynamic weather, expands your decorating options with outdoor decorations (!!!) and a brand-new Upcycled Furniture Set, as well as makes 100% World Restoration possible! We've also added the first phase of controller support, improved trash rewards, introduced auto-save, and made plenty of quality-of-life improvements based on your feedback (than","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T17:00:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329266071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1834602721188812","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"update","title":"Major Playtest Update is Here! 🦊🏡🌳 Play on June 4-19, 2026","summary":"Hi, dear Friends! 🌱The next playtest for The Regreening is finally here, and it's our biggest update yet!This time, we're introducing a brand new feature: decorating your very own Earthship Home. But that's not all! New wildlife has arrived, ecosystems have become more complex, and there are brand-new places to discover throughout Earthbound Meadow. Just click \"Join Playtest\" on our Steam page and jump right in! 👉 Please report bugs in this form: https://forms.gle/fLzSnqiS8m6UWDMG7 And don't for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T21:30:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721188812","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1832065502812226","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"Blooming May Dev Blog 🌱","summary":"Hello, Friends! 🌱 It's May, and there's already lots of greenery and sun in our part of the world! Time flies, but we were busy bees, presenting The Regreening at two events last month and running another playtest here on Steam. So let's talk about it! Playtest #2 was a success! 🌱 Can you imagine 1465 people in one room? Neither can we, but that is precisely how many of you have tried The Regreening so far! A total of 870 people joined our Playtest during the Earth Appreciation Festival Playtest","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-07T14:15:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502812226","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1830163047260243","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"Second Playtest is on! Play on April 17th-24th, 2026","summary":"Hi, dear Friends!🌱 Happy Earth Appreciation Festival to you all!!Earth Appreciation Festival is a Steam Event organised by Slug Disco in honour of Earth Day 2026! It brings together Nature and Eco-dystopian games around one powerful goal: raising awareness about the challenges we all face, like rising temperatures, collapsing ecosystems, and the growing threat to the only home we’ve got. This year, you can also support the amazing charity Cool Earth throughout the festival.As part of the celebra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T14:00:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047260243","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1828894815558490","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"First Playtest... Complete!","summary":"Hello, Friends! 🌱 Where did you all come from?! As the flowers break through the snow in spring, you broke through the long winter to play our first playtest of The Regreening. Thank you! We loved seeing you share your first impressions, valuable feedback, and helpful suggestions. It was heartwarming to realize that our game brought so much joy! Rest assured, all tricky bugs that you discovered are already being “carefully rehomed” 💚 Let us reminisce together and make sure to continue reading fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-02T19:43:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815558490","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1826362059924754","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"Our 1st Online Playtest! Play on March 6th-15th, 2026","summary":"Hello, Friends! 🌱 Just as the first flowers outside are opening their buds, we are also in full bloom of excitement!! All because we got the game ready for you to play for the very first time, NOW!Read on to learn more about this playtest, the awesome event we are part of, and a new partnership to bring The Regreening to even more players (like you!) You can play The Regreening on March 6-15, 2026!Just click \"Join Playtest\" in our Steam page, and you will gain access to the game immediately!We a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-06T16:01:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059924754","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1819386365111535","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"The Regreening's 2025 Recap","summary":"Hello, dear Regreeners! 👋What a year 2025 has been! Over the past months, we’ve been busy building, testing, and finally showing The Regreening to some players offline to get the very first feedback about the game. Things have been moving fast!!So for you, our favourite online audience, we've put together a recap of the year to say thank you for following along, wishlisting the game, and being such a kind and supportive bunch!(And if you want to talk directly to us or hang out together, we now h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-28T12:40:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365111535","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1816307528971526","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"Beautiful Games At Cozy Quest 2025!","summary":"Hey there, dear Regreeners!Cozy Quest is a warm and cheerful Steam festival organised by the lovely people at Secret Mode. We are blessed to be part of this year's selection, and to celebrate, we’ve just released our announcement trailer! You can already see it on our Steam page 🎉On top of that, we’ve just opened our Discord! It's very exciting, so come join to share a couple of your plants with us, talk about the concept of soilpunk, or simply explore more of The Regreening!Join our Discord! 🌱G","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-17T18:11:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816307528971526","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1807332909577610","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"The Regreening joins the Wholesome Games Celebration! 🌸✨","summary":"Hello, friends!! Wholesome Games Celebration is a lovely event that runs August 7–14 and brings together handpicked cozy, kind-hearted games from around the world. We’re overjoyed for The Regreening to be nestled among them like a tiny mushroom under a leafy tree. 🍄So, what’s The Regreening again?If you're just joining us, The Regreening is a cozy game about caring for plants, restoring animal habitats, befriending quirky folklore spirits, and seeing how the desert transforms into a green oasis ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-07T17:43:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909577610","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3419080-1806064758619143","game_id":"steam-3419080","kind":"announcement","title":"The Regreening is Forged in Germany! With a cozy, soft, wholesome hammer.","summary":"Hallo, dear friends! 🌱💚Today’s a special day for The Regreening. Why? Because we're part of our very first Steam event:We’re proud and very grateful to join our fellow amazing German studios and initiatives who are crafting beautiful, weird, innovative, and heartfelt games.To celebrate, we’re super excited to finally reveal what we’ve been growing in our backyards:🌍 The Regreening Steam Page is now available in whole 11 languages! (Hi, ola, привіт, ahoj, 你好merhaba, and beyond!) We want players f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-24T19:20:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806064758619143","ve